{'symbol': 'BF-B', 'date': '2022-03-15 10:34:00', 'title': "BROWN-FORMAN NAMED ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES IN 2022 BY ETHISPHERE", 'text': "LOUISVILLE, KY.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BROWN-FORMAN (NYSE:BFB) (NYSE:BFA) HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES, AS ONE OF THE 2022 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES. THIS IS BROWN-FORMAN'S FIRST YEAR BEING RECOGNIZED. IN 2022, 135 HONOREES WERE RECOGNIZED SPANNING 22 COUNTRIES AND 45 INDUSTRIES. “WE ARE DELIGHTED TO BE NAMED ONE OF THE 2022 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES, A SIGN OF BROWN-FORMAN'S LONGSTANDING COMMITMENT"}